## 🎯 **OVERVIEW**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

### What is ADF Analyzer v10?

ADF Analyzer is an **enterprise-grade toolkit** designed to parse, analyze, and visualize Azure Data Factory (ADF) ARM templates with unprecedented speed and detail.
## 📘 **ULTIMATE ENTERPRISE ADF ANALYZER v10.0**
## **PART 5: USER GUIDE** - MODERNIZED
✅ **Extensible Architecture** - Modular patch system for new types  
✅ **Lineage Tracking** - Complete data flow visualization  
✅ **Impact Analysis** - BFS-based dependency mapping  

</td>
<td width="40%">

