## ⚡ **QUICK START**

<details open>
<summary><b>🔥 Get Running in 60 Seconds</b></summary>

```bash
# ### 1️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install pandas openpyxl streamlit plotly

# ### 2️⃣ Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/adf-analyzer.git
cd adf-analyzer

# ### 3️⃣ Run analysis on your ARM template
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py your_factory_template.json

# ### 4️⃣ Launch interactive dashboard
streamlit run adf_dashboard.py
```

> **💡 Pro Tip:** Use `--patch` flag to enable extended type support:  
> `python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --patch`

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>📦 Module Quick Reference</b></summary>

| Module | Purpose | Usage |
|:-------|:--------|:------|
| 🧠 `adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py` | Core parsing engine | `python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py <template.json>` |
| 🎨 `adf_analyzer_v10_excel_enhancements.py` | Excel formatting & metrics | Auto-applied during export |
| 🔧 `adf_analyzer_v10_patch.py` | Type extensions | `--patch` flag or manual import |
| 📊 `adf_dashboard.py` | Interactive dashboard | `streamlit run adf_dashboard.py` |

</details>

