## 🏗️ **ARCHITECTURE & WORKFLOW**

### **System Architecture Overview**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd','secondaryColor':'#f3e5f5','tertiaryColor':'#e8f5e9','primaryBorderColor':'#1976d2','lineColor':'#424242'}}}%%
graph TB
    subgraph INPUT ["📥 INPUT LAYER"]
        ARM[("🗂️ ARM Template<br/>(JSON)")]
    end
    
    subgraph CORE ["⚙️ CORE ENGINE"]
        PARSER["🔍 Parser<br/>ADF v10 Complete"]
        LINEAGE["🔗 Lineage Extractor"]
        ANALYZER["📊 Analyzer Engine"]
    end
    
    subgraph EXTENSIONS ["🔌 EXTENSIONS"]
        PATCH["🔧 Patch System<br/>(Optional)"]
        CUSTOM["➕ Custom Parsers"]
    end
    
    subgraph OUTPUT ["📤 OUTPUT LAYER"]
        EXCEL["📗 Excel Workbook<br/>(30+ Sheets)"]
        DASHBOARD["📊 Streamlit Dashboard"]
        REPORTS["📄 Summary Reports"]
    end
    
    subgraph ENHANCEMENTS ["✨ ENHANCEMENTS"]
        FORMAT["🎨 Formatting Engine"]
        METRICS["📈 Metrics Calculator"]
        HYPERLINKS["🔗 Hyperlink Builder"]
    end
    
    ARM --> PARSER
    PARSER --> LINEAGE
    LINEAGE --> ANALYZER
    PATCH -.->|extends| PARSER
    CUSTOM -.->|extends| ANALYZER
    ANALYZER --> FORMAT
    FORMAT --> METRICS
    METRICS --> HYPERLINKS
    HYPERLINKS --> EXCEL
    ANALYZER --> DASHBOARD
    ANALYZER --> REPORTS
    
    classDef inputStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px,color:#000
    classDef coreStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:3px,color:#000
    classDef extStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef outputStyle fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:3px,color:#000
    classDef enhanceStyle fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    
    class ARM inputStyle
    class PARSER,LINEAGE,ANALYZER coreStyle
    class PATCH,CUSTOM extStyle
    class EXCEL,DASHBOARD,REPORTS outputStyle
    class FORMAT,METRICS,HYPERLINKS enhanceStyle
```

