## 🗂️ **MODULE STRUCTURE**

### **Component Relationships**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
classDiagram
    class ADFAnalyzerCore {
        <<Core Engine>>
        +parse_template(json_path)
        +extract_pipelines()
        +extract_datasets()
        +extract_linked_services()
        +build_lineage()
        +detect_circular_deps()
        +find_orphaned_resources()
        +export_to_excel()
        -_parse_activities()
        -_resolve_dependencies()
    }
    
    class ExcelEnhancer {
        <<Formatting Layer>>
        +apply_enterprise_formatting()
        +add_hyperlinks()
        +create_summary_sheet()
        +calculate_metrics()
        +add_conditional_formatting()
        +create_pivot_tables()
    }
    
    class PatchSystem {
        <<Extension Layer>>
        +register_activity_parser()
        +register_dataset_parser()
        +extend_trigger_support()
        +apply_patches()
        -_validate_patch()
    }
    
    class StreamlitDashboard {
        <<UI Layer>>
        +render_metrics_tiles()
        +show_lineage_graph()
        +display_dependencies()
        +filter_resources()
        +export_filtered_data()
        -_load_analysis_data()
    }
    
    ADFAnalyzerCore --> ExcelEnhancer : uses
    ADFAnalyzerCore --> PatchSystem : extends via
    ADFAnalyzerCore --> StreamlitDashboard : provides data
    ExcelEnhancer --> StreamlitDashboard : shares metrics
    
    class ADFAnalyzerCore {
        📊 Core parsing & analysis
    }
    class ExcelEnhancer {
        🎨 Output beautification
    }
    class PatchSystem {
        🔧 Extensibility
    }
    class StreamlitDashboard {
        📈 Visualization
    }
```

### **Module Responsibility Matrix**

| Component | Primary Role | Key Functions | Dependencies |
|:----------|:-------------|:--------------|:-------------|
| **🧠 Core Engine** | Parse & analyze ARM templates | `parse_template()`, `build_lineage()`, `detect_circular_deps()` | `pandas`, `json` |
| **🎨 Excel Enhancer** | Format & enrich Excel output | `apply_formatting()`, `add_hyperlinks()`, `calculate_metrics()` | `openpyxl`, Core Engine |
| **🔧 Patch System** | Extend type support | `register_parsers()`, `apply_patches()` | Core Engine |
| **📊 Dashboard** | Interactive visualization | `render_tiles()`, `show_lineage()`, `filter_resources()` | `streamlit`, `plotly`, Core Engine |

