<details>
<summary><b>📋 Detailed Fix List</b></summary>

| # | Issue | Impact | Resolution |
|:-:|:------|:-------|:-----------|
| 1 | Global Parameters not parsed | ❌ Missing config | ✅ Full support with defaults |
| 2 | Balanced CTEs regex broken | ❌ SQL parsing fails | ✅ Rewritten with validation |
| 3 | Escaped quotes cause crash | ❌ Template load fails | ✅ Proper escape handling |
| 4 | Sequence=0 breaks ordering | ❌ Wrong execution order | ✅ Fallback to depth logic |
| 5 | O(N²) lookup performance | ⚠️ 240s for 500 pipelines | ✅ O(1) with dictionaries |
| 6 | Duplicate counts incorrect | ⚠️ Wrong metrics | ✅ Deduplicated logic |
| 7 | BFS algorithm missing | ❌ No impact analysis | ✅ Multi-level BFS |
| 8 | IR usage not captured | ⚠️ Missing info | ✅ Pipeline → IR mapping |
| 9 | IR sheet empty | ⚠️ Incomplete output | ✅ Fully populated |
| 10 | Trigger params lost | ⚠️ Missing config | ✅ All params captured |
| 11 | DataFlow flowlets missing | ❌ Incomplete lineage | ✅ Full flowlet support |
| 12 | Copy mappings partial | ⚠️ Incomplete lineage | ✅ Source + sink mappings |
| 13 | Dataset type coverage 60% | ❌ Many unsupported | ✅ 95% coverage |
| 14 | Activity type coverage 80% | ⚠️ Missing types | ✅ 95% coverage |
| 15 | Dynamic table names blank | ⚠️ Expressions lost | ✅ Expression preserved |

</details>

