### **1. Flowcharts** - Process & Decision Logic

**📌 Best For:** Workflows, algorithms, decision trees, process flows

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
flowchart TD
    START([🚀 Start Analysis]) --> VALIDATE{Validate<br/>Input}
    
    VALIDATE -->|✅ Valid| LOAD[📥 Load Template]
    VALIDATE -->|❌ Invalid| ERROR1[❌ Log Error:<br/>Invalid Input]
    
    LOAD --> PARSE{Parse<br/>Resources}
    PARSE -->|Success| ANALYZE[🔍 Analyze<br/>Dependencies]
    PARSE -->|Fail| ERROR2[❌ Log Error:<br/>Parse Failed]
    
    ANALYZE --> DETECT[🔍 Detect Issues]
    DETECT --> METRICS[📊 Calculate<br/>Metrics]
    METRICS --> EXPORT[📤 Export Excel]
    
    EXPORT --> DASHBOARD[📊 Update<br/>Dashboard]
    DASHBOARD --> SUCCESS([✅ Complete])
    
    ERROR1 --> END([⚠️ End])
    ERROR2 --> END
    
    style START fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    style SUCCESS fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    style ERROR1 fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style ERROR2 fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style END fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#757575,stroke-width:2px
```

**Color Coding:**
- 🔵 **Blue** = Start/Input
- 🟢 **Green** = Success/Completion
- 🟠 **Orange** = Processing
- 🔴 **Red** = Error/Exception
- ⚫ **Gray** = End/Output

