### **4. State Diagrams** - Lifecycle & Transitions

**📌 Best For:** Resource states, processing phases, workflow stages

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initialized : Create Analyzer Instance
    
    Initialized --> Loading : load_template()
    
    Loading --> Loaded : ✅ Template Valid
    Loading --> Failed : ❌ Invalid JSON/Schema
    
    Loaded --> Parsing : parse_all_resources()
    
    Parsing --> Parsed : ✅ All Resources OK
    Parsing --> PartiallyParsed : ⚠️ Some Errors
    Parsing --> Failed : ❌ Critical Error
    
    Parsed --> Analyzing : analyze_dependencies()
    PartiallyParsed --> Analyzing : Continue with warnings
    
    Analyzing --> Analyzed : ✅ Analysis Complete
    Analyzing --> Failed : ❌ Analysis Error
    
    Analyzed --> Exporting : export_to_excel()
    
    Exporting --> Exported : ✅ Excel Created
    Exporting --> Failed : ❌ Export Error
    
    Exported --> Complete : Success
    Complete --> [*]
    
    Failed --> [*] : Log errors and exit
    
    note right of Parsing
        Processes:
        • 10 resource types
        • 44+ activity types
        • 25+ dataset types
    end note
    
    note right of Analyzing
        Operations:
        • 11 dependency types
        • Circular detection
        • BFS impact analysis
        • Orphan detection
    end note
    
    note right of Exporting
        Output:
        • 30+ Excel sheets
        • Enterprise formatting
        • Hyperlinked navigation
    end note
```

