    participant E as 📊 Excel
    
    rect rgb(225, 245, 255)
        Note over U,P: 📦 STEP 1: Environment Setup (30s)
        U->>T: Open terminal
        T->>P: python -m venv adf-env
        P-->>T: ✅ venv created
        T->>T: activate adf-env
        T-->>U: (adf-env) prompt
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over T,P: 📥 STEP 2: Install Dependencies (60s)
        T->>P: pip install pandas openpyxl
        P->>P: Download packages...
        P-->>T: ✅ Successfully installed
    end
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over U,A: ⚡ STEP 3: Run Analysis (2-3 min)
        U->>T: python adf_analyzer_v10.py factory.json
        T->>A: Initialize engine
        A->>A: Parse 327 pipelines
        A->>A: Extract dependencies
        A->>A: Detect issues
        A->>E: Generate 30+ sheets
        E-->>U: 📊 adf_analysis_latest.xlsx
    end
    
    rect rgb(225, 255, 225)
        Note over U,E: 📖 STEP 4: Review Results (10 min)
        U->>E: Open Excel file
        E-->>U: ✅ Analysis complete!
    end
```

### **Copy-Paste Quick Start**

```bash
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🚀 ADF ANALYZER - 5-MINUTE QUICK START
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 1: Create Virtual Environment (30 seconds)                │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
python -m venv adf-analyzer-env

# Activate (choose your OS):
# Windows:
adf-analyzer-env\Scripts\activate
# macOS/Linux:
source adf-analyzer-env/bin/activate

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 2: Install Dependencies (60 seconds)                      │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
pip install pandas openpyxl

# Optional: Progress bars
pip install tqdm

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 3: Download Analyzer Files                                │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
# Place these files in your project folder:
#   ✅ adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py
#   ✅ adf_analyzer_v10_patch.py (optional)
#   ✅ your_factory_template.json

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 4: Run Analysis (2-3 minutes)                             │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py your_factory_template.json

# With debug mode:
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --debug

# With patches (recommended for 95% coverage):
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --patch

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 5: View Results                                           │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
# Windows:
start output\adf_analysis_latest.xlsx
# macOS:
open output/adf_analysis_latest.xlsx
# Linux:
xdg-open output/adf_analysis_latest.xlsx

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ✅ DONE! Total time: ~5 minutes
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

