### **📊 Case Study #3: Circular Dependency Emergency**

<table>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">

**Company:** Financial Services Firm  
**Industry:** Banking  
**Challenge:** Production pipeline stuck in infinite loop at 2:15 AM

</td>
</tr>
</table>

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OPS as 🚨 Operations
    participant ENG as 👨‍💻 Engineer
    participant ADF as ⚙️ Analyzer
    participant FIX as ✅ Fix
    
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over OPS: 🔴 INCIDENT: 2:15 AM
        OPS->>ENG: Wake up! Pipeline timeout
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over ENG,ADF: Investigation (5 min)
        ENG->>ADF: Run analyzer
        ADF->>ADF: Parse factory (2 min)
        ADF->>ADF: Detect circular (1 min)
        ADF-->>ENG: Found: PL_ETL → PL_Validate<br/>→ PL_Retry → PL_ETL
    end
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over ENG,FIX: Resolution
        ENG->>FIX: Remove PL_Retry → PL_ETL link
        FIX->>FIX: Deploy fix (3 min)
        FIX-->>OPS: ✅ Production restored
    end
    
    rect rgb(225, 245, 255)
        Note over OPS: Total Resolution: 15 minutes
    end
```

**Timeline Comparison:**

| Phase | Manual | With Analyzer | Time Saved |
|:------|:------:|:-------------:|:----------:|
| **Detect Issue** | 30 min | 2 min | -28 min |
| **Root Cause** | 3 hours | 2 min | -178 min |
| **Identify Fix** | 1 hour | 1 min | -59 min |
| **Test Fix** | 45 min | 10 min | -35 min |
| **Deploy** | 5 min | 3 min | -2 min |
| **TOTAL** | **4h 50m** | **15 min** | **-94%** ⚡ |

