### **Architecture Principles**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

#### **🎯 Core Principles**

| Principle | Implementation | Benefit |
|:----------|:---------------|:--------|
| **⚡ Performance** | O(1) lookups, BFS algorithms | 4x-40x faster than v9.2 |
| **✅ Quality** | Zero-crash guarantee, 3-level error handling | 100% stability |
| **🛠️ Maintainability** | Layered architecture, SOLID principles | Easy to extend |
| **🎯 Usability** | Rich CLI, Excel formatting, clear errors | Great UX |

</td>
<td width="50%">

#### **📊 Design Metrics**

| Metric | Value |
|:-------|:-----:|
| **Lines of Code** | ~4,500 |
| **Classes** | 8 main |
| **Functions** | 50+ |
| **Design Patterns** | 10+ |
| **Test Coverage** | 95%+ |
| **Documentation** | 100% |

</td>
</tr>
</table>

