## **3.3 DATA FLOW ARCHITECTURE**

### **End-to-End Data Flow**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="100%" colspan="2">

#### **Processing Stages**

The analyzer processes data through 5 main stages:

1. **📥 Input** - Load and validate ARM template (1,000 resources)
2. **🔍 Discovery** - Classify resources by type (450 pipelines, 280 datasets, etc.)
3. **⚙️ Parsing** - Extract detailed properties from each resource
4. **📊 Analysis** - Build dependency graph, detect issues, calculate metrics
5. **📤 Output** - Generate 30+ Excel sheets with formatted results

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Data Flow Visualization**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
sankey-beta

%% Input Stage
ARM Template,Template Loader,1000
Template Loader,Schema Validator,1000

%% Resource Discovery
Schema Validator,Resource Registry,1000
Resource Registry,Pipelines,450
Resource Registry,DataFlows,120
Resource Registry,Datasets,280
Resource Registry,LinkedServices,100
Resource Registry,Triggers,50

%% Parsing Stage
Pipelines,Pipeline Parser,450
DataFlows,DataFlow Parser,120
Datasets,Dataset Parser,280
LinkedServices,LS Parser,100
Triggers,Trigger Parser,50

%% Analysis Stage
Pipeline Parser,Dependency Extractor,450
DataFlow Parser,Dependency Extractor,120
Dataset Parser,Dependency Extractor,280
LS Parser,Dependency Extractor,100
Trigger Parser,Dependency Extractor,50

Dependency Extractor,Graph Builder,1000
Graph Builder,Circular Detector,1000
Graph Builder,Orphan Detector,1000
Graph Builder,Impact Analyzer,1000

%% Output Stage
Impact Analyzer,Excel Generator,1000
Excel Generator,30+ Sheets,1000
```

### **Dependency Extraction Process**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START["📦 Parsed Resources"] --> EXT["🔗 Extract Dependencies<br/><small>11 Types</small>"]
    
    EXT --> D1["Trigger → Pipeline<br/><small>from trigger_details</small>"]
    EXT --> D2["Pipeline → DataFlow<br/><small>from ExecuteDataFlow</small>"]
    EXT --> D3["Pipeline → Pipeline<br/><small>from ExecutePipeline</small>"]
    EXT --> D4["Activity → Activity<br/><small>from dependsOn</small>"]
    EXT --> D5["Activity → Dataset<br/><small>from inputs/outputs</small>"]
    EXT --> D6["Dataset → LinkedService<br/><small>from linkedServiceName</small>"]
    EXT --> D7["DataFlow → Dataset<br/><small>from sources/sinks</small>"]
    EXT --> D8["Other Dependencies<br/><small>4 more types</small>"]
    
    D1 --> BUILD["📊 Build Dependency Graph<br/><small>Adjacency Lists</small>"]
    D2 --> BUILD
    D3 --> BUILD
    D4 --> BUILD
    D5 --> BUILD
    D6 --> BUILD
    D7 --> BUILD
    D8 --> BUILD
    
    BUILD --> GRAPH{{"🗂️ Graph Structure"}}
    
    GRAPH --> NODE1["For Each Node:<br/><small>depends_on: set</small>"]
    GRAPH --> NODE2["For Each Node:<br/><small>used_by: set</small>"]
    GRAPH --> NODE3["For Each Node:<br/><small>type: string</small>"]
    
    NODE1 --> ALGO1["🔄 Circular Detection<br/><small>DFS Traversal</small>"]
    NODE2 --> ALGO2["👻 Orphan Detection<br/><small>Usage Checking</small>"]
    NODE1 --> ALGO3["📈 Impact Analysis<br/><small>BFS Traversal</small>"]
    NODE2 --> ALGO3
    
    ALGO1 --> RESULT1["📋 Circular Dependencies<br/><small>List of cycles</small>"]
    ALGO2 --> RESULT2["📋 Orphaned Resources<br/><small>5 types</small>"]
    ALGO3 --> RESULT3["📋 Impact Analysis<br/><small>CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW</small>"]
    
    RESULT1 --> OUTPUT["📤 Export Results"]
    RESULT2 --> OUTPUT
    RESULT3 --> OUTPUT
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef processStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef algoStyle fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef outputStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class START startStyle
    class BUILD,GRAPH processStyle
    class ALGO1,ALGO2,ALGO3 algoStyle
    class OUTPUT outputStyle
```

