### **Complete Class Diagram**

<details open>
<summary><b>🔍 Click to expand full class diagram</b></summary>

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
classDiagram
    class UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer {
        <<Main Engine>>
        -json_path: str
        -data: dict
        -enable_discovery: bool
        -logger: Logger
        -resources: dict~10 types~
        -results: dict~30+ sets~
        -dependencies: dict~11 types~
        -lookup: dict~4 indexes~
        -metrics: Counter
        -graph: defaultdict
        +__init__(json_path, enable_discovery, log_level)
        +run() bool
        +load_template() bool
        +register_all_resources()
        +parse_all_resources()
        +parse_pipeline(resource)
        +parse_dataflow(resource)
        +parse_dataset(resource)
        +parse_linked_service(resource)
        +parse_trigger(resource)
        +parse_integration_runtime(resource)
        +parse_activity(activity, pipeline, seq, parent, depth) ParsedActivity
        +extract_all_dependencies()
        +detect_circular_dependencies()
        +detect_orphaned_resources()
        +analyze_impact()
        +build_pipeline_analysis()
        +export_to_excel()
        -_extract_name(name_expr) str
        -_extract_value(value) str
        -_extract_dataset_location(ds_resource) str
        -_get_nested(obj, path) Any
        -_search_nested(obj, key) Any
    }
    
    class Logger {
        <<Logging System>>
        -level: int
        -errors: list
        -warnings: list
        +__init__(level)
        +error(message, context)
        +warning(message, context)
        +info(message)
        +debug(message)
        +get_all_logs() list
    }
    
    class SQLParser {
        <<Static Utility>>
        +SQL_KEYWORDS: set
        +parse_sql(sql, max_length) tuple
        -_extract_tables(sql_upper) set
        -_extract_columns(sql, sql_upper) set
        -_remove_ctes(sql) str
        -_extract_cte_bodies_balanced(cte_section) list
        -_split_select_clause(select_part) list
        -_is_valid_table_name(name) bool
    }
    
    class TextSanitizer {
        <<Static Utility>>
        +ILLEGAL_CHARS_PATTERN: Pattern
        +sanitize_value(value, max_length) str
        +sanitize_sheet_name(name) str
    }
    
    class PathValidator {
        <<Static Utility>>
        +validate_relative_path(path, base_dir) tuple
    }
    
    class ParsedActivity {
        <<Data Class>>
        +pipeline: str
        +name: str
        +activity_type: str
        +sequence: int
        +depth: int
        +parent: str
        +role: str
        +integration_runtime: str
        +dataset: str
        +dataflow: str
        +linked_pipeline: str
        +source_table: str
        +sink_table: str
        +sql: str
        +tables: list
        +columns: list
        +stored_procedure: str
        +file_path: str
        +parameters: list
        +dependencies: list
        +dependency_conditions: list
        +values_info: str
        +description: str
        +to_dict() dict
    }
    
    class Config {
        <<Static Configuration>>
        +EXCEL_MAX_ROWS: int
        +SHEET_SPLIT_THRESHOLD: int
        +MAX_SQL_LENGTH: int
        +MAX_ACTIVITY_DEPTH: int
        +COMPLEXITY_CRITICAL_THRESHOLD: int
        +SUPPORTED_SCHEMAS: list
    }
    
    class ResourceType {
        <<Enumeration>>
        PIPELINE
        DATAFLOW
        DATASET
        LINKED_SERVICE
        TRIGGER
        INTEGRATION_RUNTIME
        CREDENTIAL
        MANAGED_VNET
        MANAGED_PRIVATE_ENDPOINT
        GLOBAL_PARAMETER
    }
    
    class ImpactLevel {
        <<Enumeration>>
        CRITICAL
        HIGH
        MEDIUM
        LOW
        UNKNOWN
    }
    
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> Logger : uses
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> SQLParser : uses
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> TextSanitizer : uses
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> PathValidator : uses
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> ParsedActivity : creates
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer --> Config : uses
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer ..> ResourceType : references
    UltimateEnterpriseADFAnalyzer ..> ImpactLevel : references
```

</details>

### **Design Patterns Catalog**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

#### **Creational Patterns**

| Pattern | Usage | Benefit |
|:--------|:------|:--------|
| **🏭 Factory** | Resource type detection | Extensibility |
| **🧱 Builder** | DataFrame construction | Flexibility |
| **🔒 Singleton** | Logger instance | Single source of truth |

</td>
<td width="50%">

#### **Structural Patterns**

| Pattern | Usage | Benefit |
|:--------|:------|:--------|
| **🎭 Facade** | `run()` method | Simplified interface |
| **🔌 Adapter** | JSON to ParsedActivity | Data transformation |
| **🎀 Decorator** | Error handling wrappers | Cross-cutting concerns |

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Pattern: Strategy (Parser Selection)**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START["parse_activity()"] --> DETECT{{"Detect<br/>Activity Type"}}
    
    DETECT -->|"Copy"| S1["🔄 CopyActivityStrategy<br/><small>_parse_copy_activity</small>"]
    DETECT -->|"ExecuteDataFlow"| S2["🌊 DataFlowStrategy<br/><small>_parse_execute_dataflow_activity</small>"]
    DETECT -->|"StoredProcedure"| S3["📊 StoredProcStrategy<br/><small>_parse_stored_procedure_activity</small>"]
    DETECT -->|"Databricks"| S4["🎯 DatabricksStrategy<br/><small>_parse_databricks_activity</small>"]
    DETECT -->|"Web"| S7["🌐 WebStrategy<br/><small>_parse_web_activity</small>"]
    DETECT -->|"Other"| S8["📦 GenericStrategy<br/><small>_extract_datasets_from_activity</small>"]
    
    S1 --> RESULT["ParsedActivity Object"]
    S2 --> RESULT
    S3 --> RESULT
    S4 --> RESULT
    S7 --> RESULT
    S8 --> RESULT
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef detectStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:3px
    classDef strategyStyle fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef resultStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    
    class START startStyle
    class DETECT detectStyle
    class S1,S2,S3,S4,S7,S8 strategyStyle
    class RESULT resultStyle
```

<div align="center">

```
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ 💡 DESIGN PATTERN BENEFITS                                       ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ • Strategy Pattern: Easy to add new activity parsers            ║
║ • Factory Pattern: Automatic resource type detection            ║
