## **3.5 PROCESSING PIPELINE**

### **Analysis Lifecycle**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **Processing Stages**

1. **📥 Initialization** - Create analyzer, load configuration
2. **📄 Template Loading** - Parse JSON, validate schema
3. **🔍 Resource Discovery** - Classify resources by type
4. **⚙️ Parsing** - Extract properties from each resource (ordered)
5. **🔗 Dependency Extraction** - Build dependency graph
6. **📊 Analysis** - Detect issues, calculate metrics
7. **📤 Export** - Generate Excel with 30+ sheets
8. **✅ Complete** - Return success/failure status

</td>
<td width="40%">

**Processing Order Matters:**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    IR["1. Integration<br/>Runtimes"]
    LS["2. Linked<br/>Services"]
    DS["3. Datasets"]
    DF["4. Data<br/>Flows"]
    PL["5. Pipelines"]
    TR["6. Triggers"]
    
    IR --> LS
    LS --> DS
    DS --> DF
    DF --> PL
    PL --> TR
    
    style IR fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
    style TR fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Complete State Machine**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initialized: Create Analyzer
    
    Initialized --> LoadingTemplate: load_template()
    
    LoadingTemplate --> TemplateValidation: Parse JSON
    TemplateValidation --> TemplateLoaded: ✅ Schema Valid
    TemplateValidation --> Failed: ❌ Invalid Schema
    
    TemplateLoaded --> RegisteringResources: register_all_resources()
    RegisteringResources --> ResourcesRegistered: Type Detection Complete
    
    ResourcesRegistered --> ParsingResources: parse_all_resources()
    
    state ParsingResources {
        [*] --> ParseIR: Integration Runtimes
        ParseIR --> ParseLS: Linked Services
        ParseLS --> ParseDatasets: Datasets
        ParseDatasets --> ParseDataFlows: Data Flows
        ParseDataFlows --> ParsePipelines: Pipelines
        ParsePipelines --> ParseTriggers: Triggers
        ParseTriggers --> [*]
    }
    
    ParsingResources --> ResourcesParsed: ✅ All Parsed
    
    ResourcesParsed --> ExtractingDependencies: extract_all_dependencies()
    ExtractingDependencies --> DependenciesExtracted: Graph Built
    
    DependenciesExtracted --> DetectingCircular: detect_circular_dependencies()
    DetectingCircular --> DetectingOrphans: DFS Complete
    
    DetectingOrphans --> AnalyzingImpact: detect_orphaned_resources()
    AnalyzingImpact --> BuildingAnalysis: analyze_impact() - BFS
    
    BuildingAnalysis --> CalculatingStats: build_pipeline_analysis()
    CalculatingStats --> ExportingExcel: All Metrics Ready
    
    ExportingExcel --> Complete: export_to_excel()
    
    Complete --> [*]: ✅ Analysis Successful
    Failed --> [*]: ❌ Analysis Failed
    
    note right of TemplateValidation
        • Validates ARM schema
        • Extracts global parameters
        • Counts resources
    end note
    
    note right of ParsingResources
        Order matters for dependencies:
        IR → LS → DS → DF → PL → TR
    end note
    
    note right of DependenciesExtracted
        • 11 dependency types
        • Bidirectional graph
        • O(1) lookups ready
    end note
```

### **Activity Parsing Recursion**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START["parse_nested_activities<br/><small>activities, pipeline, parent, depth, seq</small>"] --> CHECK{{"depth > MAX?"}}
    
    CHECK -->|"Yes ❌"| ERROR["Log Error<br/><small>Max Depth Exceeded</small>"]
    CHECK -->|"No ✅"| LOOP{{"More<br/>Activities?"}}
    
    LOOP -->|"Yes"| PARSE["parse_activity<br/><small>current activity</small>"]
    LOOP -->|"No"| RETURN["Return seq"]
    
    PARSE --> INCREMENT["seq += 1"]
    
    INCREMENT --> NESTED{{"Has Nested<br/>Activities?"}}
    
    NESTED -->|"ForEach"| FOREACH["Get nested activities<br/><small>depth+1</small>"]
    NESTED -->|"IfCondition"| IF["Get true/false branches<br/><small>depth+1</small>"]
    NESTED -->|"Switch"| SWITCH["Get case branches<br/><small>depth+1</small>"]
    NESTED -->|"Until"| UNTIL["Get loop activities<br/><small>depth+1</small>"]
    NESTED -->|"None"| LOOP
    
    FOREACH --> RECURSE["🔄 parse_nested_activities<br/><small>RECURSIVE CALL</small>"]
    IF --> RECURSE
    SWITCH --> RECURSE
    UNTIL --> RECURSE
    
    RECURSE --> UPDATE["Update seq from recursion"]
    UPDATE --> LOOP
    
    ERROR --> RETURN
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef processStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef recurseStyle fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:3px
    classDef endStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    
    class START startStyle
    class PARSE,INCREMENT processStyle
    class RECURSE recurseStyle
    class RETURN endStyle
    class ERROR errorStyle
```

