### **Optimization Strategies**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph LR
    subgraph OLD ["❌ v9.2 Slow Approach"]
        O1["🔁 Nested Loops<br/><small>Pipeline × Activity</small>"]
