```

### **BFS vs DFS Algorithm Choice**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

#### **Why BFS for Impact Analysis?**

| Aspect | BFS | DFS |
|:-------|:----|:----|
| **Depth Tracking** | ✅ Accurate levels | ❌ Incorrect depths |
| **Use Case** | Impact analysis | Circular detection |
| **Complexity** | O(V + E) | O(V + E) |
| **Memory** | Higher | Lower |
| **Result** | Level-by-level | Path-by-path |

</td>
<td width="50%">

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    NODE["Pipeline X"]
    L1A["Direct Dep A"]
    L1B["Direct Dep B"]
    L2A["Transitive C"]
    L2B["Transitive D"]
    
    NODE --> L1A
    NODE --> L1B
    L1A --> L2A
    L1B --> L2B
    
    classDef level0 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    classDef level1 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef level2 fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px
    
    class NODE level0
    class L1A,L1B level1
    class L2A,L2B level2
```

**BFS ensures correct depth**

</td>
</tr>
</table>

