pip list

# ✅ Expected packages (minimum):
# Package         Version
# --------------- -------
# pandas          1.5.3
# openpyxl        3.1.2
# numpy           1.24.3
# tqdm            4.66.1
# et-xmlfile      1.1.0

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ STEP 7: Download Analyzer Files (2 minutes)                    │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Download these files to C:\ADF-Analyzer:
