## **5.1 GETTING STARTED**

### **First-Time User Journey**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **What to Expect**

Your first analysis experience with ADF Analyzer takes approximately **20-30 minutes** from start to finish:

- ⏱️ **Setup** (5 min) - Activate environment, locate template
- ⚡ **Execution** (2-5 min) - Run analyzer, wait for completion
- 📊 **Review** (15-20 min) - Explore Excel output, find insights
- 🎯 **Action** (varies) - Share findings, create tasks

</td>
<td width="40%">

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
pie title Time Distribution
    "Setup" : 25
    "Execution" : 20
    "Review" : 50
    "Action" : 5
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Complete Journey Map**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
journey
    title Your First Analysis - Complete Journey
    section Preparation (5 min)
      Activate virtual environment: 5: You
      Verify installation: 5: You
      Locate ARM template: 4: You
      Review template size: 3: You
    section Execution (2 min)
      Run analyzer command: 5: You
      Watch console output: 4: You, Analyzer
      Wait for completion: 3: You
    section Review Results (15 min)
      Open Excel file: 5: You
      Read Summary sheet: 5: You
      Check CircularDependencies: 4: You
      Review ImpactAnalysis: 5: You
      Explore PipelineAnalysis: 5: You
      Check OrphanedResources: 4: You
      Review DataLineage: 5: You
      Understand metrics: 4: You
    section Take Action (varies)
      Share with team: 5: You, Team
      Create action items: 4: Team
      Fix critical issues: 3: Team
      Document findings: 4: Team
```

### **Quick Start Decision Flow**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph TD
    START(["🚀 First Time User"]) --> CHECK{{"Have ARM<br/>Template?"}}
    
    CHECK -->|"No"| GET["📥 Export from<br/>Azure Portal"]
    CHECK -->|"Yes"| VERIFY["✅ Verify JSON Format"]
    
    GET --> VERIFY
    
    VERIFY --> SIZE{{"📏 File Size?"}}
    
    SIZE -->|"< 10 MB"| SMALL["⚡ Quick Analysis<br/>~30 seconds"]
    SIZE -->|"10-50 MB"| MEDIUM["📊 Standard Analysis<br/>1-2 minutes"]
    SIZE -->|"50-100 MB"| LARGE["📈 Large Analysis<br/>2-5 minutes"]
    SIZE -->|"> 100 MB"| HUGE["🏢 Enterprise Analysis<br/>5-10 minutes"]
    
    SMALL --> RUN["▶️ Run Command:<br/>python analyzer.py template.json"]
    MEDIUM --> RUN
    LARGE --> RUN
    HUGE --> RUN
    
    RUN --> WAIT["⏳ Wait for Completion"]
    
    WAIT --> SUCCESS{{"✅ Success?"}}
    
    SUCCESS -->|"Yes"| OPEN["📊 Open Excel Report"]
    SUCCESS -->|"No"| ERROR["❌ Check Error Log"]
    
    OPEN --> EXPLORE["🔍 Explore 30+ Sheets"]
    
    EXPLORE --> INSIGHTS["💡 Find Insights:<br/>• Circular Deps<br/>• Orphaned Resources<br/>• Impact Analysis"]
    
    ERROR --> FIX["🔧 Fix Issues<br/>See Troubleshooting"]
    FIX --> RUN
    
    INSIGHTS --> ACTION["🎯 Take Action"]
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    classDef runStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef insightsStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    
    class START startStyle
    class RUN runStyle
    class INSIGHTS insightsStyle
    class ERROR errorStyle
```

