## **5.2 COMMAND-LINE INTERFACE**

### **CLI Command Structure**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **Command Anatomy**

```bash
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py <template.json> [OPTIONS]
```

**Components:**

- **`python`** - Python interpreter
- **`adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py`** - Main script
- **`<template.json>`** - ARM template (REQUIRED)
- **`[OPTIONS]`** - Optional flags (--debug, --quiet, etc.)

</td>
<td width="40%">

**Available Options:**

| Flag | Purpose |
|:-----|:--------|
| `--help` | Show help |
| `--version` | Show version |
| `--debug` | Verbose logging |
| `--quiet` | Minimal output |
| `--no-discovery` | Skip pattern discovery |

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Complete CLI Reference**

<details open>
<summary><b>📋 Click for complete command reference</b></summary>

```bash
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# COMMAND-LINE INTERFACE - COMPLETE REFERENCE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ BASIC USAGE                                                     │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Standard analysis (most common)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory_template.json

# With relative path
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py ./templates/factory_dev.json

# With absolute path (Windows)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py C:\Projects\ADF\factory_prod.json

# With absolute path (Mac/Linux)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py /home/user/projects/adf/factory_prod.json

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ LOGGING OPTIONS                                                 │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Debug mode - verbose output (troubleshooting)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --debug

# Quiet mode - errors only (production runs)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --quiet

# Info mode (default) - balanced output
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ PERFORMANCE OPTIONS                                             │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Disable pattern discovery (faster for large factories)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --no-discovery

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ COMBINED OPTIONS                                                │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Debug + No discovery
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --debug --no-discovery

# Quiet + No discovery (fastest)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json --quiet --no-discovery

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ HELP & VERSION                                                  │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Display help (shows all options)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py --help
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py -h

# Display version
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py --version

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ PATH WITH SPACES (requires quotes)                             │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Windows
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py "C:\My Projects\ADF Factory\template.json"

# Mac/Linux
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py "/home/user/My Projects/ADF Factory/template.json"

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ OUTPUT REDIRECTION (advanced)                                   │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Save console output to log file
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json > analysis.log 2>&1

# Append to existing log
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json >> analysis.log 2>&1

# Suppress all output (check exit code only)
python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py factory.json > /dev/null 2>&1
echo $?  # 0 = success, 1 = failure

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ BATCH PROCESSING (multiple templates)                          │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Windows batch script
FOR %%F IN (templates\*.json) DO (
    python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py "%%F" --quiet
)

# Bash script (Mac/Linux)
for template in templates/*.json; do
    python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py "$template" --quiet
done

# PowerShell
Get-ChildItem -Path templates -Filter *.json | ForEach-Object {
    python adf_analyzer_v10_complete.py $_.FullName --quiet
}
```

</details>

### **Exit Codes**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Exit Code Reference:**

| Code | Meaning | Action |
|:----:|:--------|:-------|
| **0** | ✅ Success | Review Excel output |
| **1** | ❌ Failure | Check error log |
| **130** | ⚠️ Interrupted | Re-run if needed |

</td>
<td width="50%">

**Common Failure Reasons:**

- File not found
- Invalid JSON format
- Missing dependencies
- Parse error
- Out of memory
- Invalid ARM schema

