## **5.3 RUNNING YOUR FIRST ANALYSIS**

### **Complete Analysis Workflow**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant CLI as 💻 CLI
    participant A as ⚙️ Analyzer
    participant P as 🔍 Parser
    participant E as 📊 Excel
    participant O as 📁 Output
    
    U->>CLI: python analyzer.py template.json
    
    rect rgb(225, 245, 255)
        Note over CLI,A: Phase 1: Initialization (1s)
        CLI->>A: Create instance
        A->>A: Initialize state
        A-->>U: Show banner
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 244, 225)
        Note over A,P: Phase 2: Loading (2-5s)
        A->>P: load_template()
        P->>P: Read JSON
        P->>P: Validate schema
        P-->>A: Template loaded
        A-->>U: ✅ Validated
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 225, 255)
        Note over A,P: Phase 3: Registration (3-10s)
        A->>P: register_all_resources()
        loop For each resource
            P->>P: Detect type
            P->>P: Store in registry
        end
        P-->>A: 234 resources
        A-->>U: ✅ Registered
    end
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over P: Phase 4: Parsing (20-60s)
        A->>P: parse_all_resources()
        P->>P: Parse all types
        P-->>A: All parsed
        A-->>U: ✅ 1,234 activities
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 225, 240)
        Note over A: Phase 5: Analysis (10-30s)
        A->>A: extract_dependencies()
        A-->>U: ✅ 2,456 deps
        A->>A: detect_circular()
        A-->>U: ⚠️ 2 circular
        A->>A: detect_orphans()
        A-->>U: ⚠️ 18 orphaned
        A->>A: analyze_impact()
        A-->>U: ✅ Impact done
    end
    
    rect rgb(225, 255, 255)
        Note over E: Phase 6: Excel (20-40s)
        A->>E: export_to_excel()
        loop For each sheet
            E->>E: Create & format
        end
        E->>O: Write file
        O-->>U: 📊 Excel ready
    end
    
    rect rgb(225, 255, 225)
        Note over U: Complete
        A-->>U: ✅ Success!
    end
```

