### **Reading Priority Guide**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **Recommended Reading Order**

1. **Summary** (Must Read) - 5 minutes
2. **CircularDependencies** (CRITICAL if any) - 10 minutes
3. **ImpactAnalysis** (Important) - 10 minutes
4. **PipelineAnalysis** (Key Metrics) - 15 minutes
5. **OrphanedResources** (Cleanup) - 10 minutes
6. **DataLineage** (Understanding) - 10 minutes
7. **Activities** (Reference) - As needed
8. **Others** (Deep Dive) - As needed

