### **Summary Sheet Guide**

<div align="center">

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 📊 SUMMARY SHEET - WHAT TO LOOK FOR                             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                 │
│ Section 1: METADATA                                             │
│ ✓ Analysis Date       - When was this generated?               │
│ ✓ Source File         - Which factory was analyzed?            │
│ ✓ Analyzer Version    - Ensure v10.0                           │
│                                                                 │
│ Section 2: RESOURCES                                            │
│ ✓ Total Resources     - Overall factory size                   │
│ ✓ Pipelines           - Core ETL/ELT processes                 │
│ ✓ DataFlows           - Data transformation logic              │
│ ✓ Datasets            - Data sources/sinks                     │
│ ✓ LinkedServices      - Connection managers                    │
│ ✓ Triggers            - Schedulers                             │
│                                                                 │
│ Section 3: PARSED DATA                                          │
│ ✓ Total Activities    - All pipeline steps                     │
│ ✓ Dependencies        - Relationships found                    │
│ ✓ Data Lineage        - Source→Sink flows                      │
│                                                                 │
│ Section 4: QUALITY (⚠️ CRITICAL)                                │
│ 🔴 Circular Dependencies - MUST BE ZERO in production          │
│ ⚠️  Orphaned Resources   - Should be <5% of total              │
│                                                                 │
│ Section 5: IMPACT ANALYSIS                                      │
│ ✓ CRITICAL Impact     - High-risk changes                      │
│ ✓ HIGH Impact         - Important pipelines                    │
│ ✓ MEDIUM Impact       - Moderate importance                    │
│ ✓ LOW Impact          - Standalone/orphaned                    │
│                                                                 │
│ Section 6: ACTIVITY TYPES                                       │
│ ✓ Top 10 Activities   - Most common activity types             │
│ ✓ Copy Activities     - Data movement percentage               │
│ ✓ DataFlow Activities - Transformation percentage              │
│                                                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

</div>

### **CircularDependencies Sheet (CRITICAL)**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    OPEN["📋 Open CircularDependencies"] --> CHECK{{"Any Rows?"}}
    
    CHECK -->|"No rows"| GOOD["✅ EXCELLENT<br/>No circular dependencies<br/>Safe to deploy"]
    
    CHECK -->|"Has rows"| BAD["🔴 CRITICAL ISSUE<br/>Review each cycle"]
    
    BAD --> ANALYZE["🔍 For Each Cycle"]
    
    ANALYZE --> FIELDS["Review Fields:<br/>• Type (Pipeline/Activity)<br/>• Cycle (A → B → C → A)<br/>• Length (# of steps)<br/>• Severity (CRITICAL/HIGH)<br/>• Impact (description)"]
    
    FIELDS --> ACTION{{"🎯 Action Required"}}
    
    ACTION --> FIX1["🔧 Break Cycle:<br/>Remove one dependency"]
    
    ACTION --> FIX2["♻️ Refactor:<br/>Extract common logic"]
    
    ACTION --> FIX3["📊 Use Variables:<br/>Pass data via variables"]
    
    FIX1 --> VERIFY["✅ Verify Fix:<br/>Re-run analyzer"]
    FIX2 --> VERIFY
    FIX3 --> VERIFY
    
    VERIFY --> RECHECK{{"Still Shows<br/>Cycle?"}}
    
    RECHECK -->|"No"| FIXED["✅ FIXED!<br/>Deploy to production"]
    RECHECK -->|"Yes"| ACTION
    
    classDef goodStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    classDef badStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:3px
    classDef fixedStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    
    class GOOD goodStyle
    class BAD badStyle
    class FIXED fixedStyle
```

**Example Circular Dependency:**

<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Cycle</th>
<th>Length</th>
<th>Severity</th>
<th>Impact</th>
<th>Recommendation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Pipeline</td>
<td>PL_ETL_Customer → PL_Validate_Customer → PL_Retry_Customer → PL_ETL_Customer</td>
<td>3</td>
<td>🔴 CRITICAL</td>
<td>Infinite execution loop - Production blocker</td>
