### **ImpactAnalysis Sheet**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Key Columns:**

| Column | Description |
|:-------|:------------|
| **Pipeline** | Pipeline name |
| **Impact** | CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW |
| **BlastRadius** | Total affected resources |
| **DirectUpstreamTriggers** | Triggers that start this |
| **DirectUpstreamPipelines** | Pipelines that call this |
| **TransitiveUpstreamPipelines** | Indirect callers (L1, L2, L3) |
| **DirectDownstreamPipelines** | Pipelines this calls |
| **TransitiveDownstreamPipelines** | Indirect called (L1, L2, L3) |
| **UsedDataFlows** | DataFlows this executes |
| **UsedDatasets** | Datasets this reads/writes |
| **IsOrphaned** | Yes/No unused indicator |

</td>
<td width="50%">

**Impact Level Guide:**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    CRITICAL["🔴 CRITICAL<br/><small>High upstream & downstream</small>"]
    HIGH["🟠 HIGH<br/><small>Significant dependencies</small>"]
    MEDIUM["🟡 MEDIUM<br/><small>Moderate dependencies</small>"]
    LOW["🟢 LOW<br/><small>Standalone/orphaned</small>"]
    
    CRITICAL --> R1["Change Risk: VERY HIGH"]
    HIGH --> R2["Change Risk: HIGH"]
    MEDIUM --> R3["Change Risk: MEDIUM"]
    LOW --> R4["Change Risk: LOW"]
    
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef highStyle fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef mediumStyle fill:#fffde7,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef lowStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class CRITICAL criticalStyle
    class HIGH highStyle
    class MEDIUM mediumStyle
    class LOW lowStyle
```

</td>
</tr>
