## **5.5 COMMON WORKFLOWS**

### **Workflow 1: Monthly Factory Health Check**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START(["📅 Monthly Health Check"]) --> ANALYZE["▶️ Run Full Analysis"]
    
    ANALYZE --> CHECK1{{"🔄 Circular<br/>Dependencies?"}}
    
    CHECK1 -->|"Found"| FIX1["🔴 CRITICAL<br/>Fix immediately"]
    CHECK1 -->|"None"| CHECK2{{"👻 Orphaned<br/>Resources > 10%?"}}
    
    FIX1 --> DEPLOY1["Deploy Fix"]
    DEPLOY1 --> CHECK2
    
    CHECK2 -->|"Yes"| FIX2["⚠️ Plan Cleanup<br/>Review with team"]
    CHECK2 -->|"No"| CHECK3{{"⚡ CRITICAL Impact<br/>Pipelines Changed?"}}
    
    FIX2 --> CLEANUP["Schedule Cleanup Sprint"]
    CLEANUP --> CHECK3
    
    CHECK3 -->|"Yes"| FIX3["📋 Document Changes<br/>Update runbooks"]
    CHECK3 -->|"No"| CHECK4{{"⚡ Performance<br/>Issues?"}}
    
    FIX3 --> UPDATE["Update Documentation"]
    UPDATE --> CHECK4
    
    CHECK4 -->|"Yes"| FIX4["🔍 Review Complexity<br/>Optimize pipelines"]
    CHECK4 -->|"No"| REPORT["📊 Generate Report"]
    
    FIX4 --> OPTIMIZE["Create Optimization Tasks"]
    OPTIMIZE --> REPORT
    
    REPORT --> SHARE["📧 Share with Team"]
    SHARE --> END(["✅ Complete"])
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warningStyle fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef endStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class START startStyle
    class FIX1 criticalStyle
    class FIX2 warningStyle
    class END endStyle
```

### **Workflow 2: Pre-Deployment Validation**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as 👨‍💻 Developer
    participant ADF as 🏭 ADF (Dev)
    participant Analyzer as ⚙️ Analyzer
    participant Review as 👥 Code Review
    participant Prod as 🚀 ADF (Prod)
    
    Dev->>ADF: Make changes
    Dev->>ADF: Export ARM template
    
    Dev->>Analyzer: Run analysis on DEV
    Analyzer->>Analyzer: Parse & Analyze
    Analyzer-->>Dev: Report: ✅ No issues
    
    Dev->>Review: Submit PR with template
    Review->>Analyzer: Run analysis in CI/CD
    
    alt No Circular Dependencies
        Analyzer-->>Review: ✅ Clean
        Review->>Review: Approve PR
        Review->>Prod: Deploy to Production
        Prod-->>Dev: ✅ Deployed Successfully
    else Circular Dependencies Found
        Analyzer-->>Review: 🔴 Circular Dep Detected
        Review->>Dev: ❌ Block PR - Fix Required
        Dev->>ADF: Fix circular dependency
        Dev->>Analyzer: Re-run analysis
    end
```

### **Workflow 3: Migration Planning**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START(["🎯 Plan Migration:<br/>Dev → Prod"]) --> ANALYZE["📊 Run Impact Analysis<br/>on SOURCE factory"]
    
    ANALYZE --> IDENTIFY["🏷️ Identify Pipeline Groups:<br/>By Impact Level"]
    
    IDENTIFY --> G1["🔴 CRITICAL Impact<br/>45 pipelines"]
    IDENTIFY --> G2["🟠 HIGH Impact<br/>132 pipelines"]
    IDENTIFY --> G3["🟢 MEDIUM/LOW Impact<br/>150 pipelines"]
    
    G1 --> PHASE1["📅 Phase 1: CRITICAL<br/>Week 1-2<br/>High risk, high value"]
    G2 --> PHASE2["📅 Phase 2: HIGH<br/>Week 3-4<br/>Important dependencies"]
    G3 --> PHASE3["📅 Phase 3: MEDIUM/LOW<br/>Week 5-6<br/>Minimal risk"]
    
    PHASE1 --> TEST1["🧪 Test Phase 1<br/>in STAGING"]
    PHASE2 --> TEST2["🧪 Test Phase 2<br/>in STAGING"]
    PHASE3 --> TEST3["🧪 Test Phase 3<br/>in STAGING"]
    
    TEST1 --> VERIFY1{{"✅ All Tests Pass?"}}
    TEST2 --> VERIFY2{{"✅ All Tests Pass?"}}
    TEST3 --> VERIFY3{{"✅ All Tests Pass?"}}
    
    VERIFY1 -->|"No"| FIX1["🔧 Fix Issues"]
    VERIFY2 -->|"No"| FIX2["🔧 Fix Issues"]
    VERIFY3 -->|"No"| FIX3["🔧 Fix Issues"]
    
    FIX1 --> TEST1
    FIX2 --> TEST2
    FIX3 --> TEST3
    
    VERIFY1 -->|"Yes"| DEPLOY1["🚀 Deploy Phase 1<br/>to PROD"]
    VERIFY2 -->|"Yes"| DEPLOY2["🚀 Deploy Phase 2<br/>to PROD"]
    VERIFY3 -->|"Yes"| DEPLOY3["🚀 Deploy Phase 3<br/>to PROD"]
    
    DEPLOY1 --> MONITOR1["👀 Monitor 48 hours"]
    DEPLOY2 --> MONITOR2["👀 Monitor 48 hours"]
    DEPLOY3 --> MONITOR3["👀 Monitor 24 hours"]
    
    MONITOR1 --> DEPLOY2
    MONITOR2 --> DEPLOY3
    MONITOR3 --> COMPLETE(["✅ Migration Complete<br/>Zero Downtime"])
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef highStyle fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef lowStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef completeStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    
    class START startStyle
    class G1 criticalStyle
    class G2 highStyle
    class G3 lowStyle
    class COMPLETE completeStyle
```

### **Workflow 4: Troubleshooting Production Issues**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph LR
    ALERT["🚨 Production Alert:<br/>Pipeline Failure"] --> EXPORT["📥 Export ARM Template<br/>from Production"]
    
    EXPORT --> ANALYZE["⚙️ Run Analyzer<br/>with --debug"]
    
    ANALYZE --> CHECK1{{"🔄 Circular<br/>Dependency?"}}
    
    CHECK1 -->|"Yes"| ROOT1["🎯 Root Cause:<br/>Infinite Loop"]
    CHECK1 -->|"No"| CHECK2{{"👻 Orphaned<br/>Dataset?"}}
    
    CHECK2 -->|"Yes"| ROOT2["🎯 Root Cause:<br/>Broken Reference"]
    CHECK2 -->|"No"| CHECK3{{"🔗 Complex<br/>Dependencies?"}}
    
    CHECK3 -->|"Yes"| ROOT3["🎯 Root Cause:<br/>Execution Order Issue"]
    CHECK3 -->|"No"| CHECK4["📋 Review<br/>ActivityExecutionOrder"]
    
    ROOT1 --> FIX1["🔧 Break Cycle"]
    ROOT2 --> FIX2["🔧 Restore Dataset"]
    ROOT3 --> FIX3["🔧 Fix dependsOn"]
    CHECK4 --> FIX4["🔧 Adjust Sequence"]
    
    FIX1 --> VERIFY["✅ Re-run Analyzer<br/>Verify Fix"]
    FIX2 --> VERIFY
    FIX3 --> VERIFY
    FIX4 --> VERIFY
    
    VERIFY --> DEPLOY["🚀 Deploy Hotfix"]
    
    classDef alertStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:3px
    classDef verifyStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef deployStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    
    class ALERT alertStyle
    class VERIFY verifyStyle
    class DEPLOY deployStyle
```

