## **6.2 ACTIVITY ANALYSIS (44+ TYPES)**

### **Feature At A Glance**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **What It Does**

The Activity Analyzer uses a **Strategy Pattern** to parse 44+ different activity types, each with specialized extraction logic for their unique properties.

**Key Capabilities:**
- ✅ **44+ Activity Types** - Comprehensive coverage
- ✅ **Strategy Pattern** - Modular, extensible parsers
- ✅ **3-Level IR Lookup** - Activity → LinkedService → Dataset
- ✅ **Column Mappings** - Up to 30 mappings per Copy activity
- ✅ **Nested Activities** - ForEach, IfCondition, Switch, Until

</td>
<td width="40%">

**Top Activity Types:**

| Type | Typical % |
|:-----|:---------:|
| Copy | 36% |
| ExecuteDataFlow | 10% |
| StoredProcedure | 7% |
| Lookup | 5% |
| ForEach | 4% |
| IfCondition | 3% |
| Web | 2% |
| Script | 2% |
| Others | 31% |

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Activity Type Taxonomy**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Data Movement (4 types):**
- Copy, Delete, GetMetadata, Validation

**Data Transformation (2 types):**
- ExecuteDataFlow, Script

**Stored Procedures (4 types):**
- SqlServer, AzureSQL, Synapse, Custom

**Control Flow (6 types):**
- ForEach, IfCondition, Switch, Until, Wait, Filter

</td>
<td width="50%">

**External Compute (15+ types):**
- Databricks (3), Synapse (2), AzureML (2)
- HDInsight (5), DataLakeAnalytics, AzureFunction

**Web Integration (3 types):**
- WebActivity, WebHook, Lookup

**Orchestration (3 types):**
- ExecutePipeline, Fail, SetVariable, AppendVariable

</td>
</tr>
</table>

