### **Integration Runtime 3-Level Lookup**

<div align="center">

```
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ 🖥️ INTEGRATION RUNTIME LOOKUP PRIORITY                          ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Priority: Activity > LinkedService > Dataset's LS > Default     ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Level 1: Check activity.typeProperties.integrationRuntime       ║
║ Level 2: Check linkedServiceName.connectVia                     ║
║ Level 3: Check input dataset's LS.connectVia                    ║
║ Default: Use AutoResolveIntegrationRuntime                      ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

</div>

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Activity
    participant L1 as Level 1: Activity IR
    participant L2 as Level 2: LinkedService IR
    participant L3 as Level 3: Dataset's LS IR
    participant Default
    
    Activity->>L1: Check typeProperties.integrationRuntime
    
    alt Has Activity-level IR
        L1-->>Activity: ✅ Found: MyCustomIR
    else No Activity-level IR
        Activity->>L2: Check linkedServiceName.connectVia
        
        alt Has LinkedService IR
            L2-->>Activity: ✅ Found: SelfHostedIR
        else No LinkedService IR
            Activity->>L3: Check input dataset's LS.connectVia
            
            alt Has Dataset's LS IR
                L3-->>Activity: ✅ Found: VNetIR
            else No IR at any level
                Activity->>Default: Use default
                Default-->>Activity: ⚙️ AutoResolveIR
            end
        end
    end
    
    Note over Activity,Default: Priority ensures correct runtime context
```

