## **6.5 ORPHANED RESOURCE DETECTION**

### **Feature At A Glance**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **What It Does**

Identifies unused resources by tracking usage during parsing and comparing against all registered resources.

**Key Capabilities:**
- ✅ **Usage Tracking** - Mark resources as used during parsing
- ✅ **5 Resource Types** - Pipelines, DataFlows, Datasets, LinkedServices, Triggers
- ✅ **Set Difference** - O(N) comparison for orphan identification
- ✅ **Reason Analysis** - Why resource is orphaned
- ✅ **Cleanup Candidates** - Safe-to-delete identification

</td>
<td width="40%">

**Typical Orphan Rates:**

| Resource Type | Orphan % |
|:--------------|:--------:|
| Pipelines | 5-10% |
| Datasets | 10-15% |
| LinkedServices | 15-20% |
| DataFlows | 3-5% |
| Triggers (stopped) | 5-10% |

**Target:** < 5% overall

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Orphan Detection Strategy**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph TB
    START["🔍 Start Detection"] --> TRACK["📊 Usage Tracking<br/><small>Sets Initialization</small>"]
    
    TRACK --> T1["📦 pipelines_used = set()"]
    TRACK --> T2["📊 datasets_used = set()"]
    TRACK --> T3["🔗 linkedservices_used = set()"]
    TRACK --> T4["🌊 dataflows_used = set()"]
    TRACK --> T5["⏰ triggers_used = set()"]
    
    T1 --> POPULATE["⚙️ Populate During Parsing"]
    T2 --> POPULATE
    T3 --> POPULATE
    T4 --> POPULATE
    T5 --> POPULATE
    
    POPULATE --> P1["Mark pipeline used<br/><small>when trigger references it</small>"]
    POPULATE --> P2["Mark dataset used<br/><small>when activity uses it</small>"]
    POPULATE --> P3["Mark dataflow used<br/><small>when ExecuteDataFlow calls it</small>"]
    POPULATE --> P4["Mark LS used<br/><small>when dataset references it</small>"]
    
    P1 --> COMPARE{{"📐 Compare Sets"}}
    P2 --> COMPARE
    P3 --> COMPARE
    P4 --> COMPARE
    
    COMPARE --> C1["all_pipelines - pipelines_used<br/><small>= orphaned_pipelines</small>"]
    COMPARE --> C2["all_datasets - datasets_used<br/><small>= orphaned_datasets</small>"]
    COMPARE --> C3["all_linkedservices - linkedservices_used<br/><small>= orphaned_linkedservices</small>"]
    COMPARE --> C4["all_dataflows - dataflows_used<br/><small>= orphaned_dataflows</small>"]
    
    C1 --> REASON1["📋 Reason:<br/><small>No trigger or ExecutePipeline</small>"]
    C2 --> REASON2["📋 Reason:<br/><small>Not used by any activity</small>"]
