## **6.6 IMPACT ANALYSIS (BFS ALGORITHM)**

### **Feature At A Glance**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **What It Does**

Uses **Breadth-First Search (BFS)** algorithm to calculate multi-level impact of pipeline changes by traversing upstream and downstream dependencies.

**Key Capabilities:**
- ✅ **BFS Algorithm** - Level-by-level traversal for accurate depth
- ✅ **Bidirectional Search** - Both upstream (callers) and downstream (called)
- ✅ **4 Impact Levels** - CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW
- ✅ **Blast Radius** - Total affected resource count
- ✅ **O(V + E) Complexity** - Optimal graph traversal

</td>
<td width="40%">

**Impact Level Distribution:**

| Level | Typical % | Description |
|:------|:---------:|:------------|
| **CRITICAL** | 15% | High upstream & downstream |
| **HIGH** | 30% | Significant dependencies |
| **MEDIUM** | 40% | Moderate dependencies |
| **LOW** | 15% | Standalone/orphaned |

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **BFS vs DFS: Why BFS for Impact Analysis?**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**✅ BFS - Correct Depth Tracking**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    BFS1["Start: A<br/><small>Level 0</small>"] --> BFS2["Level 1:<br/><small>B, C</small>"]
    BFS2 --> BFS3["Level 2:<br/><small>D, E, F</small>"]
    BFS3 --> BFS4["Level 3:<br/><small>G, H</small>"]
    
    BFS4 --> BFS_RESULT["✅ Result:<br/><small>L1: {B, C}</small><br/><small>L2: {D, E, F}</small><br/><small>L3: {G, H}</small>"]
    
    classDef bfsStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    class BFS1,BFS2,BFS3,BFS4,BFS_RESULT bfsStyle
```

**Advantage:** Accurate level-by-level tracking

</td>
<td width="50%">

**❌ DFS - Incorrect Depth**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    DFS1["Start: A"] --> DFS2["Visit B<br/><small>L1</small>"]
    DFS2 --> DFS3["Visit D<br/><small>L2</small>"]
    DFS3 --> DFS4["Visit G<br/><small>L3 ✅</small>"]
    DFS4 --> DFS5["Backtrack"]
    DFS5 --> DFS6["Visit E<br/><small>L3 ❌ Wrong!</small>"]
    DFS6 --> DFS7["Visit C<br/><small>L4 ❌ Wrong!</small>"]
    
    DFS7 --> DFS_RESULT["❌ Result:<br/><small>L1: {B}</small><br/><small>L3: {D, E, G}</small><br/><small>L4: {C} - WRONG!</small>"]
    
    classDef dfsStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    class DFS1,DFS2,DFS3,DFS4,DFS5,DFS6,DFS7,DFS_RESULT dfsStyle
```

**Problem:** Depth depends on traversal order

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **BFS Algorithm for Multi-Level Impact**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph TD
    START["🎯 Start Impact Analysis<br/><small>For Pipeline X</small>"] --> INIT["📋 Initialize BFS"]
    
    INIT --> Q1["📦 upstream_queue = deque<br/><small>downstream_queue = deque</small>"]
    INIT --> V1["✓ visited_upstream = set<br/><small>visited_downstream = set</small>"]
    INIT --> R1["📊 result = defaultdict<br/><small>by level</small>"]
    
    Q1 --> BFS_UP["⬆️ BFS Upstream<br/><small>Find who calls this</small>"]
    
    BFS_UP --> UP1["🚀 Start: (pipeline, depth=0)<br/><small>Add to queue</small>"]
    
    UP1 --> UP2{{"Queue<br/>not empty?"}}
    
    UP2 -->|"Yes"| UP3["📦 Dequeue: (node, depth)"]
    UP2 -->|"No"| BFS_DOWN
    
    UP3 --> UP4{{"depth < MAX?"}}
    
    UP4 -->|"Yes"| UP5["🔍 Get upstream:<br/><small>graph[node]['used_by']</small>"]
    UP4 -->|"No"| UP2
    
    UP5 --> UP6{{"For each<br/>upstream node"}}
    
    UP6 -->|"Not visited"| UP7["✏️ Mark visited<br/><small>Add to queue (depth+1)</small><br/><small>Store in result[depth+1]</small>"]
    UP6 -->|"Visited"| UP6
    UP6 -->|"All done"| UP2
    
    UP7 --> UP6
    
    BFS_DOWN["⬇️ BFS Downstream<br/><small>Find what this calls</small>"] --> DOWN1["🚀 Start: (pipeline, depth=0)"]
    
    DOWN1 --> DOWN2{{"Queue<br/>not empty?"}}
    
    DOWN2 -->|"Yes"| DOWN3["📦 Dequeue: (node, depth)"]
    DOWN2 -->|"No"| CALCULATE
    
    DOWN3 --> DOWN4{{"depth < MAX?"}}
    
    DOWN4 -->|"Yes"| DOWN5["🔍 Get downstream:<br/><small>graph[node]['depends_on']</small>"]
    DOWN4 -->|"No"| DOWN2
    
    DOWN5 --> DOWN6{{"For each<br/>downstream node"}}
    
    DOWN6 -->|"Not visited"| DOWN7["✏️ Mark visited<br/><small>Add to queue (depth+1)</small><br/><small>Store in result[depth+1]</small>"]
    DOWN6 -->|"Visited"| DOWN6
    DOWN6 -->|"All done"| DOWN2
    
    DOWN7 --> DOWN6
    
    CALCULATE["📊 Calculate Impact Level"] --> LOGIC{{"🎯 Logic"}}
    
    LOGIC -->|"Has upstream<br/>& downstream"| CRITICAL["🔴 CRITICAL<br/><small>Middle of chain</small>"]
    LOGIC -->|"Has upstream<br/>only"| HIGH["🟠 HIGH<br/><small>Entry point</small>"]
    LOGIC -->|"Has downstream<br/>only"| MEDIUM["🟡 MEDIUM<br/><small>Isolated flow</small>"]
    LOGIC -->|"No dependencies"| LOW["🟢 LOW<br/><small>Orphaned</small>"]
    
    CRITICAL --> STORE["💾 Store Impact Record"]
    HIGH --> STORE
    MEDIUM --> STORE
    LOW --> STORE
    
    STORE --> BLAST["📐 Calculate Blast Radius:<br/><small>SUM all dependencies</small>"]
    
    BLAST --> RESULT["✅ Impact Analysis<br/>Complete"]
    
    classDef startStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bfsStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef resultStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class START startStyle
    class BFS_UP,BFS_DOWN,UP1,UP2,UP3,UP4,UP5,DOWN1,DOWN2,DOWN3,DOWN4,DOWN5 bfsStyle
    class CRITICAL criticalStyle
    class RESULT resultStyle
```

### **Impact Level Calculation**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph TD
    PIPELINE["📊 Analyze Pipeline X"] --> CHECK1{{"Has Direct<br/>Upstream?"}}
    
    CHECK1 -->|"Yes"| HAS_UP["✓ Has Upstream"]
    CHECK1 -->|"No"| NO_UP["✗ No Upstream"]
    
    HAS_UP --> CHECK2{{"Has Direct<br/>Downstream?"}}
