## **7.1 EXCEL OUTPUT STRUCTURE**

### **File Architecture Overview**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **Output File Locations**

The analyzer generates multiple Excel files for redundancy and historical tracking:

- **`adf_analysis_latest.xlsx`** - Always points to most recent analysis
- **`adf_analysis_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.xlsx`** - Timestamped archives
- **`streamlit_app/data/adf_analysis_latest.xlsx`** - Dashboard copy (auto-synced)

**Naming Convention:**
```
adf_analysis_2024_01_15_14_30_22.xlsx
             └─┬─┘ └─┬─┘ └──┬──┘
              Year   Date   Time
```

</td>
<td width="40%">

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph TD
    ROOT["📁 Project Root"]
    ROOT --> LATEST["📗 adf_analysis_latest.xlsx<br/><small>Main File</small>"]
    ROOT --> ARCHIVE["📗 adf_analysis_..._archived.xlsx"]
    ROOT --> STREAM["📁 streamlit_app/data/<br/>📗 adf_analysis_latest.xlsx"]
    
    style LATEST fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:3px
    style ROOT fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

