## **7.2 CRITICAL SHEETS DEEP DIVE**

### **Sheet 1: Summary - Your Navigation Hub**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="65%">

#### **Summary Sheet Structure**

The **Summary** sheet is your starting point for every analysis. It contains:

1. **📅 Metadata** - Analysis date, source file, version
2. **📦 Resources** - Counts by type with hyperlinks
3. **⚙️ Parsed Data** - Activities, dependencies, lineage
4. **🔴 Quality Flags** - Critical issues requiring attention
5. **🎯 Impact Distribution** - Pipeline risk levels
6. **📊 Top Activities** - Most common activity types

**Average Review Time:** 2-5 minutes

</td>
<td width="35%">

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
pie title Summary Sections
    "Metadata" : 15
    "Resources" : 25
    "Parsed Data" : 15
    "Quality Flags" : 25
    "Impact Dist" : 10
    "Top Activities" : 10
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

