╠═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                                   ║
║ 📅 METADATA                                                       ║
║ ├─ Analysis Date:        2024-01-15 14:30:22                     ║
║ ├─ Source File:          factory_arm_template.json               ║
║ ├─ Analyzer Version:     10.0 - Production Ready                 ║
║ └─ Processing Time:      47.3 seconds                            ║
║                                                                   ║
║ 📦 RESOURCES                                                      ║
║ ├─ Total Resources:      234                                     ║
║ ├─ → Pipelines:          45     📊 [See: PipelineAnalysis]       ║
║ ├─ → DataFlows:          15     📊 [See: DataFlows]              ║
║ ├─ → Datasets:           89     📊 [See: Datasets]               ║
║ ├─ → LinkedServices:     12     📊 [See: LinkedServices]         ║
