### **Sheet 2: CircularDependencies - Production Blocker Detector**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    OPEN["📋 Open CircularDependencies<br/>Sheet"] --> CHECK{{"Any<br/>Rows?"}}
    
    CHECK -->|"🟢 Empty<br/>(0 rows)"| SAFE["✅ SAFE TO DEPLOY<br/>No circular dependencies<br/>Proceed with confidence"]
    
    CHECK -->|"🔴 Has Rows<br/>(>0)"| CRITICAL["🚨 CRITICAL ISSUE<br/>DO NOT DEPLOY<br/>Production Blocker"]
    
    CRITICAL --> REVIEW["<b>REVIEW EACH ROW:</b><br/>• Type: Pipeline or Activity<br/>• Cycle: A→B→C→A<br/>• Length: # of steps<br/>• Severity: CRITICAL/HIGH<br/>• Impact: Description<br/>• Recommendation: How to fix"]
    
    REVIEW --> UNDERSTAND["<b>UNDERSTAND IMPACT:</b><br/>• Infinite execution loop<br/>• Resource exhaustion<br/>• Unpredictable behavior<br/>• Production outage risk"]
    
    UNDERSTAND --> FIX["<b>FIX IMMEDIATELY:</b><br/>1. Identify cycle path<br/>2. Choose break point<br/>3. Remove dependency<br/>4. Re-run analyzer<br/>5. Verify sheet empty"]
    
    FIX --> VERIFY{{"Sheet Now<br/>Empty?"}}
    
    VERIFY -->|"✅ Yes"| SAFE
    VERIFY -->|"❌ No"| REVIEW
    
    SAFE --> DEPLOY["✅ Safe to Deploy"]
    
    classDef safeStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:4px
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c,stroke-width:4px
    classDef deployStyle fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:3px
    
    class SAFE safeStyle
    class CRITICAL criticalStyle
    class DEPLOY deployStyle
```

**CircularDependencies - Column Reference:**

| Column | Description | Example |
|:-------|:------------|:--------|
| **Type** | Resource type (Pipeline/Activity) | "Pipeline" |
| **Cycle** | Full dependency loop | "PL_ETL → PL_Validate → PL_Retry → PL_ETL" |
| **Length** | Number of steps in cycle | 3 |
| **Severity** | Impact level | "CRITICAL" |
| **Impact** | What will happen if deployed | "Infinite execution loop - Production blocker" |
| **Recommendation** | How to fix | "Remove PL_Retry → PL_ETL link" |

<div align="center">

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 🔴 CRITICAL: ZERO TOLERANCE FOR CIRCULAR DEPENDENCIES           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                 │
│ If this sheet has ANY rows:                                    │
│                                                                 │
│ 1. ⛔ DO NOT DEPLOY TO PRODUCTION                               │
│ 2. 🚨 FIX IMMEDIATELY before any other work                     │
│ 3. ✅ RE-RUN ANALYZER to verify fix                            │
│ 4. 📋 DOCUMENT THE FIX for team knowledge                       │
│ 5. 🔄 ONLY DEPLOY AFTER SHEET IS EMPTY                         │
│                                                                 │
│ Circular dependencies cause:                                   │
│ • Infinite execution loops                                     │
│ • Resource exhaustion & crashes                                │
│ • Unpredictable execution behavior                             │
│ • Production outages & data loss                               │
│                                                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

</div>

### **Sheet 3: ImpactAnalysis - Change Risk Calculator**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="100%" colspan="2">

**ImpactAnalysis Sheet Overview:**

This sheet uses **BFS (Breadth-First Search)** algorithm to calculate the "blast radius" of changes to each pipeline.

</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Key Metrics:**

- **Impact Level** - CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW
- **BlastRadius** - Total affected resources
- **Upstream Dependencies** - What triggers/calls this
- **Downstream Dependencies** - What this calls
- **Transitive Dependencies** - Indirect impacts (L1, L2, L3)

</td>
<td width="50%">

**Use Cases:**

1. ✅ Pre-deployment validation
2. ✅ Change impact assessment
3. ✅ Prioritizing regression testing
4. ✅ Identifying critical pipelines
5. ✅ Planning staged rollouts

</td>
</tr>
</table>

**Complete Column Reference:**

<details>
<summary><b>📋 Click to expand all 19 columns</b></summary>

| # | Column | Description |
|:-:|:-------|:------------|
| 1 | **Pipeline** | Pipeline name |
| 2 | **Impact** | CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW risk level |
| 3 | **BlastRadius** | Total affected resources (sum of all deps) |
| 4 | **DirectUpstreamTriggers** | Trigger names that start this pipeline |
| 5 | **DirectUpstreamTriggerCount** | Number of triggers |
| 6 | **DirectUpstreamPipelines** | Pipeline names that call this via ExecutePipeline |
| 7 | **DirectUpstreamPipelineCount** | Number of caller pipelines |
| 8 | **TransitiveUpstreamPipelines** | Indirect callers (L1:names \| L2:names \| L3:names) |
| 9 | **TransitiveUpstreamCount** | Total transitive upstream count |
| 10 | **DirectDownstreamPipelines** | Pipelines this calls via ExecutePipeline |
| 11 | **DirectDownstreamPipelineCount** | Number of called pipelines |
| 12 | **TransitiveDownstreamPipelines** | Indirect called (L1:names \| L2:names \| L3:names) |
| 13 | **TransitiveDownstreamCount** | Total transitive downstream count |
| 14 | **UsedDataFlows** | DataFlow names executed by this pipeline |
| 15 | **DataFlowCount** | Number of DataFlows used |
| 16 | **DatasetCount** | Number of Datasets used (read or write) |
| 17 | **UsedDatasets** | Dataset names (first 100) |
| 18 | **IsOrphaned** | Yes/No - not triggered or called |
| 19 | **OrphanReason** | Why it's orphaned (if applicable) |

</details>

**Impact Level Decision Tree:**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
graph TD
    START{{"Calculate<br/>Impact"}} --> CALC["BlastRadius =<br/>UpstreamTriggers +<br/>UpstreamPipelines +<br/>DownstreamPipelines +<br/>Transitive"]
    
    CALC --> CHECK1{{"BlastRadius<br/>≥ 20?"}}
    
    CHECK1 -->|"Yes"| CRITICAL["🔴 CRITICAL<br/>BlastRadius: 20+<br/>Multiple callers & calls others"]
    
    CHECK1 -->|"No"| CHECK2{{"BlastRadius<br/>≥ 10?"}}
    
    CHECK2 -->|"Yes"| HIGH["🟠 HIGH<br/>BlastRadius: 10-19<br/>Significant dependencies"]
    
    CHECK2 -->|"No"| CHECK3{{"BlastRadius<br/>≥ 3?"}}
    
    CHECK3 -->|"Yes"| MEDIUM["🟡 MEDIUM<br/>BlastRadius: 3-9<br/>Moderate dependencies"]
    
    CHECK3 -->|"No"| LOW["🟢 LOW<br/>BlastRadius: 0-2<br/>Standalone/orphaned"]
    
    CRITICAL --> ACTION1["Change Protocol:<br/>• Full regression test<br/>• Staged deployment<br/>• Rollback plan ready<br/>• Stakeholder notification"]
    
    HIGH --> ACTION2["Change Protocol:<br/>• Test with callers<br/>• Check schedules<br/>• Notify stakeholders"]
    
    MEDIUM --> ACTION3["Change Protocol:<br/>• Standard testing<br/>• Normal deployment"]
    
    LOW --> ACTION4["Change Protocol:<br/>• Basic validation<br/>• Consider deletion"]
    
    classDef criticalStyle fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c,stroke-width:3px
    classDef highStyle fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef mediumStyle fill:#fffde7,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef lowStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class CRITICAL criticalStyle
    class HIGH highStyle
    class MEDIUM mediumStyle
    class LOW lowStyle
```

