- `TotalActivities` - Pipeline size
- `ComplexityScore` - Weighted metric (0-200+)
- `MaxNestingDepth` - How deep nesting goes
- `ImpactLevel` - CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW
- `IsOrphaned` - Cleanup candidate
- `DatasetCount` - Data touchpoints

