<td colspan="5"><b>SOURCE/TARGET (4 columns)</b></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>24</td>
<td><b>SourceSystems</b></td>
<td>Number</td>
<td>Unique source systems count</td>
<td>0-10</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>25</td>
<td><b>TargetSystems</b></td>
<td>Number</td>
<td>Unique target systems count</td>
<td>0-10</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>26</td>
<td><b>IsMultiSource</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if SourceSystems > 1, else "No"</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>27</td>
<td><b>IsMultiTarget</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if TargetSystems > 1, else "No"</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#ffe1e1;">
<td colspan="5"><b>CAPABILITIES (4 columns)</b></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>28</td>
<td><b>HasSQL</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if contains any SQL code, else "No"</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>29</td>
<td><b>HasStoredProcedures</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if contains Stored Procedure activities</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>30</td>
<td><b>HasCopyActivity</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if contains Copy activities</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>31</td>
<td><b>HasDataFlow</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if contains DataFlow activities</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#fff3e0;">
<td colspan="5"><b>METRICS (3 columns)</b></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>32</td>
<td><b>ComplexityScore</b></td>
<td>Number</td>
<td>Weighted complexity: TotalActivities×2 + Depth×5 + Loops×10</td>
<td>0-200+ (>100 = complex)</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>33</td>
<td><b>Complexity</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>Category: Low (<50), Medium (50-100), High (100-150), Critical (>150)</td>
<td>"Low", "Medium", "High", "Critical"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>34</td>
<td><b>Parameters</b></td>
<td>Number</td>
<td>Number of pipeline parameters defined</td>
<td>0-50</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#f5f5f5;">
<td colspan="5"><b>STATUS (3 columns)</b></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>35</td>
<td><b>IsOrphaned</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>"Yes" if not triggered or called, else "No"</td>
<td>"Yes" or "No"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>36</td>
<td><b>ImpactLevel</b></td>
<td>Text</td>
<td>From ImpactAnalysis: change risk level</td>
<td>"CRITICAL", "HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>37</td>
<td><b>Variables</b></td>
<td>Number</td>
<td>Number of pipeline variables defined</td>
<td>0-20</td>
</tr>

</tbody>
</table>

</details>

**Complexity Score Formula:**

```
ComplexityScore = (TotalActivities × 2) + 
                  (MaxNestingDepth × 5) + 
                  (LoopActivities × 10) + 
                  (ConditionalActivities × 5)

Categories:
  Low:      0-49
  Medium:   50-99
  High:     100-149
  Critical: 150+
```

