## **7.4 ANALYSIS SHEETS**

### **DataLineage Sheet - Source to Sink Tracking**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="60%">

#### **DataLineage Overview**

This sheet maps **every data movement** in your factory, from source to sink.

**Key Features:**
- 📊 Complete source→sink tracking
- 🔍 Pipeline and activity context
- 📦 Dataset to table/file mapping
- 🔄 Transformation type identification

**Use Cases:**
1. ✅ Impact analysis for source changes
2. ✅ Downstream dependency discovery
3. ✅ Data flow documentation
4. ✅ Compliance audits (data lineage proof)
5. ✅ Finding all consumers of a dataset

</td>
<td width="40%">

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e3f2fd'}}}%%
graph LR
    SOURCE["📥 Source<br/>Dataset/Table"] --> TRANSFORM["⚙️ Transformation<br/>Pipeline/Activity"]
    TRANSFORM --> SINK["📤 Sink<br/>Dataset/Table"]
    
    style SOURCE fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    style TRANSFORM fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9933cc,stroke-width:2px
    style SINK fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

**Column Reference:**

| Column | Description | Example |
|:-------|:------------|:--------|
| **Pipeline** | Pipeline containing the data movement | "PL_Customer_ETL" |
| **Activity** | Activity performing the movement | "Copy_RawData" |
| **Type** | Activity type (Copy or ExecuteDataFlow) | "Copy" |
| **Source** | Source dataset name | "DS_SQL_Customers" |
| **SourceTable** | Actual source table/file path | "dbo.Customers" |
| **Sink** | Sink dataset name | "DS_Blob_Staging" |
| **SinkTable** | Actual target table/file path | "raw/customers/" |
| **Transformation** | Description of what happens | "Copy" or "DataFlow: DF_Clean" |

**Sample Data Lineage Flow:**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
graph LR
    subgraph SOURCES ["📥 SOURCES"]
        S1["dbo.Customers<br/><small>SQL Server</small>"]
        S2["api/orders<br/><small>REST API</small>"]
    end
    
    subgraph STAGING ["🏗️ STAGING"]
        ST1["raw/customers/<br/><small>Blob Storage</small>"]
        ST2["raw/orders/<br/><small>Blob Storage</small>"]
    end
    
    subgraph CLEAN ["🧹 CLEAN"]
        CL1["clean/customers/<br/><small>Blob Storage</small>"]
        CL2["clean/orders/<br/><small>Blob Storage</small>"]
    end
    
    subgraph WAREHOUSE ["🏢 WAREHOUSE"]
        W1["dbo.dim_customer<br/><small>Synapse</small>"]
        W2["dbo.fact_orders<br/><small>Synapse</small>"]
    end
    
    S1 -->|"PL_Extract<br/>Copy_Customers"| ST1
    S2 -->|"PL_Extract<br/>Web_GetOrders"| ST2
    
    ST1 -->|"PL_Transform<br/>DF_CleanCustomers"| CL1
    ST2 -->|"PL_Transform<br/>DF_CleanOrders"| CL2
    
    CL1 -->|"PL_Load<br/>Copy_ToSynapse"| W1
    CL2 -->|"PL_Load<br/>Copy_ToSynapse"| W2
    
    style S1 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    style S2 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
