    style W2 fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
```

### **ActivityExecutionOrder Sheet - Flow Control**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Purpose:** Shows the execution sequence of activities with dependencies.

**Key Columns:**
- **Pipeline** - Parent pipeline
- **Sequence** - Execution order (1, 2, 3...)
- **Activity** - Activity name
- **Parent** - Parent container (if nested)
- **Depth** - Nesting level (0=top-level)
- **Dependencies** - Activities this depends on
- **DependencyConditions** - Success/Failed/Completed/Skipped

</td>
<td width="50%">

**Use Cases:**
1. ✅ Understanding execution flow
2. ✅ Debugging dependency issues
3. ✅ Optimizing parallel execution
4. ✅ Troubleshooting failures
5. ✅ Creating execution diagrams

</td>
</tr>
</table>

**Execution Order Example:**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
graph TD
    START([Pipeline Start]) --> ACT1["Seq:1 Lookup_Config<br/><small>Depth:0</small>"]
    
    ACT1 --> ACT2["Seq:2 Copy_Extract<br/><small>Depth:0<br/>DependsOn: Lookup_Config</small>"]
    
    ACT2 --> ACT3["Seq:3 ForEach_Process<br/><small>Depth:0<br/>DependsOn: Copy_Extract</small>"]
    
    ACT3 --> ACT4["Seq:4 Copy_Item<br/><small>Parent: ForEach_Process<br/>Depth:1</small>"]
    
    ACT4 --> ACT5["Seq:5 Validate_Item<br/><small>Parent: ForEach_Process<br/>Depth:1<br/>DependsOn: Copy_Item</small>"]
    
    ACT3 --> ACT6["Seq:6 SP_UpdateStats<br/><small>Depth:0<br/>DependsOn: ForEach_Process</small>"]
    
    ACT6 --> END([Pipeline End])
    
    style ACT1 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    style ACT3 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    style ACT4 fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9933cc,stroke-width:2px
    style ACT5 fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9933cc,stroke-width:2px
```

