```

### **OrphanedPipelines Sheet**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="100%" colspan="2">

**What Makes a Pipeline Orphaned?**

A pipeline is considered orphaned if:
1. ❌ No **Started** triggers reference it
2. ❌ No **ExecutePipeline** activities call it
3. ❌ Not part of any active execution chain

</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

**Column Reference:**

| Column | Description |
|:-------|:------------|
| **Pipeline** | Pipeline name |
| **Reason** | Why it's orphaned |
| **Type** | "Orphaned" classification |
| **Recommendation** | Suggested action |

</td>
<td width="50%">

**Typical Reasons:**

- 🔴 Development leftover
- 🔴 Test pipeline
- 🔴 Deprecated process
- 🟡 Trigger stopped/deleted
- 🟡 Temporarily disabled
- 🟢 Kept for future use (document!)

</td>
</tr>
</table>

**Sample OrphanedPipelines Data:**

```
┌──────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────┬─────────────────────────┐
│ Pipeline             │ Reason                                        │ Type     │ Recommendation          │
├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────┼─────────────────────────┤
│ PL_Legacy_Export     │ Not referenced by any Started trigger or      │ Orphaned │ Add trigger or verify   │
│                      │ ExecutePipeline activity                      │          │ if still needed         │
├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────┼─────────────────────────┤
│ PL_Test_Backup       │ Not referenced by any Started trigger or      │ Orphaned │ Delete if test complete │
│                      │ ExecutePipeline activity                      │          │                         │
├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────┼─────────────────────────┤
│ PL_Archive_Old_2023  │ Not referenced by any Started trigger or      │ Orphaned │ Confirm deprecated,     │
│                      │ ExecutePipeline activity                      │          │ then remove             │
└──────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────┴─────────────────────────┘
```

### **Orphan Cleanup Workflow**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Excel as 📗 Excel Sheet
    participant Team as 👥 Team
    participant Decision as 🤔 Decision
    participant ADF as 🏭 Azure ADF
    
    User->>Excel: Open OrphanedPipelines
    Excel-->>User: Shows 12 orphaned pipelines
    
    User->>User: Sort by Pipeline name
    User->>User: Filter if needed
    
    loop For each orphaned resource
        User->>Team: "Is PL_XYZ still needed?"
        
        alt Confirmed NOT Needed
            Team->>Decision: ✅ Delete
            Decision->>ADF: Delete from factory
            Decision->>User: ✅ Deleted
            User->>User: Mark in tracking list
        else Needed for Future
            Team->>Decision: 📝 Keep & Document
            Decision->>User: Add to "Keep List"
            User->>User: Document reason
            Note over User: Add comment:<br/>"Kept for Q2 migration"
        else Uncertain
            Team->>Decision: ⏳ Investigate further
            Decision->>User: Assign to owner
            User->>Team: Create investigation task
        end
    end
    
    User->>ADF: Export new ARM template
    User->>User: Re-run analyzer
    User->>Excel: Verify orphan count reduced
    
    Excel-->>User: New count: 5 (down from 12) ✅
```

### **Orphan Reduction Best Practices**

<div align="center">

```
╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║           🧹 ORPHAN CLEANUP BEST PRACTICES                    ║
╠═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                               ║
║ 📅 WEEKLY REVIEW:                                             ║
║   • Check OrphanedPipelines sheet                            ║
║   • Review with team (15-20 min meeting)                     ║
║   • Categorize: Delete / Keep / Investigate                  ║
║                                                               ║
║ 📋 DOCUMENTATION:                                             ║
║   • Maintain "Keep List" document                            ║
║   • Include reason for keeping                               ║
║   • Set review date (3-6 months)                             ║
║                                                               ║
║ 🎯 TARGET METRICS:                                            ║
║   • Small factory (<20 PLs): 0-2 orphans acceptable         ║
║   • Medium factory (20-100): 0-5 orphans acceptable          ║
║   • Large factory (100+): 0-15 orphans acceptable            ║
║   • Target: <5% of total resources orphaned                  ║
║                                                               ║
║ ⚠️ WHAT TO DELETE:                                            ║
║   • Test/POC pipelines (after confirmation)                  ║
║   • Deprecated processes                                     ║
║   • Duplicates (after merge)                                 ║
║   • Failed experiments                                       ║
║                                                               ║
║ 📝 WHAT TO KEEP (with documentation):                         ║
║   • Templates for new pipelines                              ║
║   • Emergency/disaster recovery pipelines                    ║
║   • Seasonal/periodic processes (note schedule)              ║
║   • Future migration targets                                 ║
║                                                               ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

</div>

### **OrphanedTriggers - Special Cases**

**OrphanedTriggers** is unique because triggers can be orphaned in three ways:

1. **Stopped State** - Trigger exists but is stopped
2. **Broken Reference** - References non-existent pipeline
3. **Empty Configuration** - No pipelines configured

**Sample OrphanedTriggers Data:**

```
┌───────────────────┬───────────────┬─────────┬───────────────────────────────┬──────────────┬────────────────────┐
│ Trigger           │ Pipeline      │ State   │ Reason                        │ Type         │ Recommendation     │
├───────────────────┼───────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────┤
│ TR_Daily_Legacy   │ PL_OldProcess │ Stopped │ Trigger is Stopped            │ Inactive     │ Start trigger or   │
│                   │               │         │ (affects 1 pipeline)          │              │ remove if obsolete │
├───────────────────┼───────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────┤
│ TR_Broken_Ref     │ PL_Missing    │ Started │ References 1 non-existent     │ BrokenRef    │ Fix pipeline ref   │
│                   │               │         │ pipeline                      │              │ or remove trigger  │
├───────────────────┼───────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────┤
│ TR_Empty_Config   │ None          │ Started │ No pipelines configured       │ Misconfigured│ Configure or       │
│                   │               │         │                               │              │ remove trigger     │
└───────────────────┴───────────────┴─────────┴───────────────────────────────┴──────────────┴────────────────────┘
```

