### **Feature 13: Auto-Split Large Sheets**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
graph TD
    START["📊 Sheet Export"] --> CHECK{{"Row Count<br/>> 500,000?"}}
    
    CHECK -->|"No"| SINGLE["✅ Write to Single Sheet<br/>Standard export"]
    
    CHECK -->|"Yes"| SPLIT["⚠️ Auto-Split Required<br/>Prevent Excel limits"]
    
    SPLIT --> CALC["Calculate Parts:<br/>parts = ⌈rows / 500,000⌉"]
    
    CALC --> LOOP{{"For each part"}}
    
    LOOP --> SLICE["Slice data:<br/>start = i × 500,000<br/>end = (i+1) × 500,000"]
    
    SLICE --> NAME["Generate name:<br/>Activities_P1<br/>Activities_P2<br/>Activities_P3"]
    
    NAME --> WRITE["Write part to sheet"]
    
    WRITE --> LOOP
    
    LOOP -->|"All done"| WARN["⚠️ Log warning:<br/>Sheet split into N parts"]
    
    SINGLE --> DONE["✅ Export Complete"]
    WARN --> DONE
    
    classDef checkStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef splitStyle fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#cc0000,stroke-width:2px
    classDef doneStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    
    class CHECK checkStyle
    class SPLIT splitStyle
    class DONE doneStyle
```

### **Feature 12: Text Sanitization**

<div align="center">

```
╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║           🔒 TEXT SANITIZATION - EXCEL SAFETY                 ║
╠═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                               ║
║ STEP 1: Remove Illegal XML Characters                        ║
║   ✅ Remove: 0x00-0x08, 0x0B-0x0C, 0x0E-0x1F, 0x7F-0x9F      ║
║   ✅ Keep: Tab (0x09), Newline (0x0A), CR (0x0D)             ║
║                                                               ║
║ STEP 2: Normalize Whitespace                                 ║
║   ✅ Multiple spaces → Single space                          ║
║   ✅ Trim leading/trailing whitespace                        ║
║                                                               ║
║ STEP 3: Length Enforcement                                   ║
║   ✅ Cell content: Max 32,767 chars (Excel limit)            ║
║   ✅ Sheet names: Max 31 chars                               ║
║   ✅ Truncate with "..." if exceeded                         ║
║                                                               ║
║ STEP 4: Complex Object Handling                              ║
║   ✅ Dict/List → JSON string representation                  ║
║   ✅ None → Empty string ""                                  ║
║   ✅ Numbers → String conversion                             ║
║                                                               ║
║ STEP 5: Sheet Name Collision Prevention                      ║
║   ✅ If duplicate: Append _2, _3, etc.                       ║
║   ✅ Remove invalid chars: / \ ? * [ ]                       ║
║                                                               ║
║ RESULT: Zero Excel corruption errors ✅                       ║
║                                                               ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

</div>

