## **7.8 PRO TIPS & BEST PRACTICES**

### **Excel Power User Shortcuts**

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

#### **🔥 Top 10 Excel Shortcuts**

| Shortcut | Action | Use Case |
|:---------|:-------|:---------|
| `Ctrl + F` | Find | Search across all sheets |
| `Ctrl + Page Down` | Next sheet | Quick navigation |
| `Ctrl + Page Up` | Previous sheet | Quick navigation |
| `Ctrl + Home` | Jump to A1 | Reset view |
| `Ctrl + End` | Last cell | Find data boundary |
| `Ctrl + G` | Go To | Jump to specific cell |
| `F5` | Go To Special | Select data regions |
| `Alt + ↓` | Filter dropdown | Quick filter |
| `Ctrl + Shift + L` | Toggle filter | Enable/disable filters |
| `F9` | Recalculate | Refresh formulas |

</td>
<td width="50%">

#### **💡 Advanced Techniques**

**1. Multi-Sheet Search:**
```
Ctrl + F → Options >> 
Change "Within" to "Workbook"
→ Search all 30+ sheets at once!
```

**2. Custom Views:**
```
View → Custom Views → Add
→ Save specific filter/sort state
→ Quick switch between views
```

**3. Quick Analysis:**
```
Select data → Ctrl + Q
→ Instant charts, pivot tables
→ No manual setup needed
```

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### **Sheet-Specific Power Tips**

<details>
<summary><b>💪 Click for power user techniques by sheet</b></summary>

#### **Summary Sheet:**

```
🎯 Create Executive Dashboard:
1. Copy Summary metrics
2. Paste in new sheet "Dashboard"
3. Insert → Charts:
   • Pie chart: Activity distribution
   • Bar chart: Impact levels
   • Donut chart: Orphaned vs Active
4. Add slicers for interactive filtering
5. Auto-refresh with formulas linking to Summary
```

#### **PipelineAnalysis Sheet:**

```
🔥 Advanced Filter Combos:

Combo 1: Find Complex Orphans
→ Filter: IsOrphaned = Yes
→ Filter: ComplexityScore > 100
→ Result: Valuable code that might be forgotten

Combo 2: High-Risk High-Impact
→ Filter: ImpactLevel = CRITICAL
→ Filter: MaxNestingDepth > 3
→ Result: Critical pipelines that are hard to maintain

Combo 3: Multi-Source Integrations
→ Filter: IsMultiSource = Yes
→ Filter: SourceSystems > 3
→ Result: Complex integration points
```

#### **Activities Sheet:**

```
💡 SQL Code Extraction:

1. Filter: SQL column <> (blank)
2. Copy SQL column
3. Paste in text editor
4. Use regex to extract:
   - All tables: FROM|JOIN\s+(\w+\.\w+)
   - All columns: SELECT\s+(.*?)\s+FROM
5. Create frequency list
6. Identify most-accessed tables
```

#### **ImpactAnalysis Sheet:**

```
🎯 Pre-Deployment Checklist:

Step 1: Find your pipeline
→ Filter: Pipeline = "PL_YourPipeline"

Step 2: Check impact
→ Note Impact level: CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW
→ Note BlastRadius: Number

Step 3: Review dependencies
→ DirectUpstreamTriggers: Who triggers this
→ DirectDownstreamPipelines: What this calls
→ TransitiveDownstream: Ripple effects

Step 4: Create test plan
→ If CRITICAL: Test all downstream
→ If HIGH: Test direct downstream
→ If MEDIUM: Smoke test
→ If LOW: Basic validation

Step 5: Plan rollback
→ If BlastRadius > 10: Staged deployment
→ Prepare rollback ARM template
→ Document rollback procedure
```

</details>

### **Common Workflows**

```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
graph TD
    START([📗 Open Excel File]) --> WORKFLOW{{"Choose<br/>Workflow"}}
    
    WORKFLOW -->|"First-time user"| FIRST["<b>FIRST-TIME WORKFLOW:</b><br/>1. Read Summary (5 min)<br/>2. Check CircularDeps (1 min)<br/>3. Browse PipelineAnalysis (10 min)<br/>4. Explore other sheets"]
    
    WORKFLOW -->|"Daily review"| DAILY["<b>DAILY WORKFLOW:</b><br/>1. Summary quality flags (2 min)<br/>2. CircularDeps must be empty<br/>3. ImpactAnalysis for changes<br/>4. OrphanedPipelines count"]
    
    WORKFLOW -->|"Pre-deployment"| DEPLOY["<b>PRE-DEPLOYMENT:</b><br/>1. CircularDeps MUST be empty<br/>2. ImpactAnalysis for changed PLs<br/>3. Note BlastRadius<br/>4. Test all downstream<br/>5. Prepare rollback"]
    
    WORKFLOW -->|"Monthly cleanup"| CLEANUP["<b>MONTHLY CLEANUP:</b><br/>1. Review all OrphanedResources<br/>2. Team review meeting<br/>3. Delete confirmed orphans<br/>4. Document kept resources<br/>5. Re-run analyzer"]
    
    WORKFLOW -->|"Troubleshooting"| TROUBLE["<b>TROUBLESHOOTING:</b><br/>1. Check Errors sheet<br/>2. Activities → filter by pipeline<br/>3. DataLineage for data issues<br/>4. ActivityExecutionOrder"]
    
    FIRST --> USE["Put insights into action"]
    DAILY --> USE
    DEPLOY --> USE
    CLEANUP --> USE
    TROUBLE --> USE
    
    USE --> END([✅ Complete])
    
