║     → 15-minute team meeting                                 ║
║     → Delete confirmed, document kept                        ║
║                                                               ║
║  6️⃣  PRE-DEPLOYMENT: CHECK IMPACT ANALYSIS                    ║
║     → Find your changed pipelines                            ║
║     → Note BlastRadius                                       ║
║     → Test all downstream dependencies                       ║
║                                                               ║
║  7️⃣  EXPORT FILTERED DATA                                     ║
║     → File → Save As → CSV                                   ║
║     → Share subsets with team                                ║
║                                                               ║
║  8️⃣  USE CTRL+F TO SEARCH ALL SHEETS                          ║
║     → Find a pipeline name across all 30+ sheets             ║
║     → Options >> Within: Workbook                            ║
║                                                               ║
║  9️⃣  DOCUMENT YOUR "KEEP LIST"                                ║
║     → Not all orphans should be deleted                      ║
║     → Maintain separate doc explaining why kept              ║
║                                                               ║
║  🔟  SHARE INSIGHTS, NOT JUST FILES                           ║
║     → Copy Summary metrics to PowerPoint                     ║
║     → Add 1-2 sentence interpretation                        ║
║     → Highlight action items                                 ║
║                                                               ║
